From 3667bebf8d0bea07ed16218fd921d07db87aeb21 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexis Hadjisotiriou <ah@gilawa.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 13:55:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] sipt: Add robust length validations in ISUP message parser

---
